# Supplied weak baseline

`witness.json` is the same zero-control artifact as
`../input/baseline_witness.json`. It is admissible but does not meet the target.
Copy it into a writable work directory to submit the unchanged baseline.
The runnable generator remains `../workspace/baseline.py`; its interface is
